OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry night
OL,6,Fwith some lengthy clear spells.
OL,7,FBecoming chilly towards dawn, with
OL,8,Fsome isolated patches of mist and fog
OL,9,Fforming in prone rural locations.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FPartly cloudy but dry
OL,12,Finitially, cloud thickening, with rain
OL,13,Fspreading eastwards throughout the
OL,14,Fday. Turning drier by the evening, but
OL,15,Fbecoming chilly overnight as the wind
OL,16,Feases.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
