OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith hazy sunshine and light winds on
OL,7,FMonday. Cloudier and breezier on
OL,8,FTuesday, with overnight rain. Bright
OL,9,Fspells on Wednesday with isolated
OL,10,Fshowers. Temperatures close or
OL,11,Fslightly above average.
